<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Samancor details Billiton prospectus output.</title>
<headline>Samancor details Billiton prospectus output.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samancor Ltd on Tuesday advised shareholders that it had provided Gencor Ltd's newly-formed Billiton Plc with the following production figures to be included in its pathfinder prospectus.</p>
<p>Estimated total production for the year ended June 30, 1997:</p>
<p>					 (000s tonnes)</p>
<p>    Manganese ores		 2,314</p>
<p>    Manganese alloys		 470</p>
<p>    Dense-media ferrosilicon	22</p>
<p>    Manganese metal		   41</p>
<p>    Chrome ores		    2,705</p>
<p>    Chrome alloys		    881</p>
<p>    Silicon metal		     30</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
